>>> Subject: [PATCH] omap3_beagle: Init only uart3 used for console
>>>
>>> On beagle some of uart mux lines are used for other
>>> purpose so init only uart3.
>>>
>>> Uart2 rx line clashes with gpio_147 used for usb ehci
>>> phy reset.
